\item[S2] Ron Aharoni, Strongly Maximal Matchings and Strongly Minimal Covers (2022), Definition 1.2 and section 2, preceding Conjecture 2.1, pp. 1--2. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2206.02576}.
